{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:normal-bundle","title":"prop:normal-bundle","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":351,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:normal-bundle","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:normal-space]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixA#lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:normal-bundle","line":585,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[The Normal Bundle]\n\\label{prop:normal-bundle}\n\n\\uses{lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian, def:normal-space, lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame, lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles}\n\n\n\n\n\\dcref{ch2:2.16}\nIf $M^n$ is an immersed or embedded submanifold with or without boundary of a Riemannian $m$-manifold $\\widetilde M$, then $NM=\\bigsqcup_{p\\in M}N_pM$ is a smooth rank-$(m-n)$ vector subbundle of $T\\widetilde M|_M$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame,lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles,lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian}\n\\sketch The ambient tangent bundle is Riemannian by Lemma \\ref{lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian}, so Lemma \\ref{lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles} applies. Lemma \\ref{lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame} supplies local smooth frames of all fibres $N_pM$, of dimension $m-n$; Lemma \\ref{lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles} therefore makes their union a smooth subbundle.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[The Normal Bundle] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a6e6f726d616c2d62756e646c65\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian\">↗ lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Anormal-space\">↗ def:normal-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anormal-space-orthonormal-frame\">↗ lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixA%23lem%3Alocal-frame-criterion-for-subbundles\">↗ lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch2:2.16</span></span>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M^n$\">$M^n$</span> is an immersed or embedded submanifold with or without boundary of a Riemannian <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$m$\">$m$</span>-manifold <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\widetilde M$\">$\\widetilde M$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$NM=\\bigsqcup _{p\\in M}N_pM$\">$NM=\\bigsqcup _{p\\in M}N_pM$</span> is a smooth rank-<span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(m-n)$\">$(m-n)$</span> vector subbundle of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T\\widetilde M|_M$\">$T\\widetilde M|_M$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anormal-space-orthonormal-frame\">↗ lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixA%23lem%3Alocal-frame-criterion-for-subbundles\">↗ lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian\">↗ lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian</a> \\sketch The ambient tangent bundle is Riemannian by Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a616d6269656e742d74616e67656e742d62756e646c652d7269656d616e6e69616e\">5</a>, so Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixA%23lem%3Alocal-frame-criterion-for-subbundles\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixA#lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6c6f63616c2d6672616d652d637269746572696f6e2d666f722d73756262756e646c6573\">lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles</a> applies. Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anormal-space-orthonormal-frame\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6e6f726d616c2d73706163652d6f7274686f6e6f726d616c2d6672616d65\">5</a> supplies local smooth frames of all fibres <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$N_pM$\">$N_pM$</span>, of dimension <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$m-n$\">$m-n$</span>; Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixA%23lem%3Alocal-frame-criterion-for-subbundles\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixA#lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6c6f63616c2d6672616d652d637269746572696f6e2d666f722d73756262756e646c6573\">lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles</a> therefore makes their union a smooth subbundle. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#rem:normal-bundle-projections","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian","title":"lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian","label":"lem:ambient-tangent-bundle-riemannian"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:normal-space","title":"def:normal-space","label":"def:normal-space"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame","title":"lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame","label":"lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixA#lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles","title":"lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles","label":"lem:local-frame-criterion-for-subbundles"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#rem:normal-bundle-projections","title":"rem:normal-bundle-projections","label":"rem:normal-bundle-projections"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#eq:4.2","title":"eq:4.2","label":"eq:4.2"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#ex:tange